2result.sql
```

Reason:  
• 0result.sql overlooks SEGMENTATIONS and therefore under‑counts studies containing T2 Weighted Axial segmentations.  
• 1result.sql and 2result.sql both include all four required categories (DWI, T2 Weighted Axial, Apparent Diffusion Coefficient, and T2 Weighted Axial segmentations) and return the correct count of 30 unique StudyInstanceUIDs.  
• 2result.sql achieves this in a single straightforward UNION query without unnecessary CTEs, making it the simplest correct solution.